### VS Code extension: "REST Client" (humao.rest-client)
### Click "Send Request" above each block

### 1. List tasks
GET http://localhost:3000/tasks

### 2. Create a new task
POST http://localhost:3000/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Record the workflow video"
}

### 3. Complete task 2
PATCH http://localhost:3000/tasks/2/complete
